                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac3ca0a6-86c8-3b50-9c64-68ff750a68a8",
                        "entry_id": "48c28b93-4d8c-306e-8e94-5e47a3d5fec3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "метеорол. в Северной Америке: смерч, проносящийся над сушей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1502659-b68d-482c-9519-8633e15867dd",
                                "sense_id": "ac3ca0a6-86c8-3b50-9c64-68ff750a68a8",
                                "text": "Великие равнины — место знаменитых в Америке степных ураганов. Известные всем торнадо — гигантские вихри, способные, как пушинку, поднять повозку, корову, даже дом вместе с хозяином, способные, как былинку, согнуть стальные мачты электролиний, с корнем выдернуть дерево, осушить речку, — проносятся именно тут, на Великих равнинах."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "472b2436-830a-4b22-8de2-53e8260ab572",
                        "source_entry_id": "48c28b93-4d8c-306e-8e94-5e47a3d5fec3",
                        "source_sense_id": "ac3ca0a6-86c8-3b50-9c64-68ff750a68a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "tornado",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7eb07b7-073c-3eff-b3e1-bdcf97677e78",
                                        "entry_id": "3f1f14db-3a14-3e10-91ab-e9ed213dc91e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A violent wind in the form of a mobile, rapidly rotating, funnel cloud that has contacted the ground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "289da82c-568a-4dc9-a230-02a55ae5d1da",
                                                "sense_id": "c7eb07b7-073c-3eff-b3e1-bdcf97677e78",
                                                "text": "An extreme version of vorticity is a vortex. The vortex is a spinning, cyclonic mass of fluid, which can be observed in the rotation of water going down a drain, as well as in smoke rings, tornados and hurricanes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                        "entry_id": "2618e014-90a6-34e0-b32f-c4634721569b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sweep through something violently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3eb0355-5c83-4b01-a931-edde9b974f7b",
                                                "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                                "text": "And so on Friday nights, James Torin tornadoed through six beers, a carton of cigarettes, a coffee table littered with lottery tickets, and unrequited dreams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27dc917b-840a-4c64-8d7a-3495e074e363",
                                                "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                                "text": "They come every night,\nthose cavernous trains, tornadoing\nthe frozen house,\na madness feeling for the door."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c572ab59-d3b0-4f6c-8226-d0ac65aa0292",
                        "source_entry_id": "48c28b93-4d8c-306e-8e94-5e47a3d5fec3",
                        "source_sense_id": "ac3ca0a6-86c8-3b50-9c64-68ff750a68a8",
